---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Rashmi Bansal.">
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:2rem;max-width:760px">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Rashmi Bansal</h1>
    <div class="serif" style="font-size:1.2rem">
      <p>Rashmi is an author, entrepreneur and mentor. Her books on first generation entrepreneurs and changemakers, including Stay Hungry Stay Foolish, Connect the Dots and I Have a Dream, have sold over 1.2 million copies and been translated into 12 languages.</p>
      <p>She co-founded JAM, India's largest selling youth magazine, runs short story writing workshops for all ages, speaks at companies and colleges, and teaches a full-credit course at Ashoka University called The Road Less Travelled.</p>
      <p>She has written for Businessworld, Business Today, rediff.com and Dainik Bhaskar.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
